Session names
lmx and the Lemieux library name each session after a hockey player. The
name lists in lib/lemieux/id/data/nhl_players.tsv and
lib/lemieux/id/data/womens_players.tsv are derived from public NHL and PWHL
roster listings (snapshot of 2026-09-25) and from Hockey Hall of Fame player
pages for five CWHL players. Only lowercase name slugs are distributed: no
names as published, no league player ids, no source URLs. Lemieux is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the NHL, the PWHL or the Hockey Hall of Fame.

